大概介绍了过程式着色的概念。在过程式着色中，很重要的一个部分是随机数的生成。&lt;a href="https://github.com/ashima/webgl-noise" title="gl noise"&gt;这个仓库&lt;/a&gt;
实现了大量且高效的随机数生成算法。实际应用中，就可以使用这些写好的代码。接下来的部分主要简要地记录所涉及到的算法。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2-Body</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/2-body/</link><pubDate>Fri, 19 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/2-body/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Mass point system</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/masspoint/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/masspoint/</guid><description/></item><item><title>What is the Rigidbody?</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/rigidbody/</link><pubDate>Wed, 10 Feb 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/rigidbody/</guid><description/></item><item><title>The Laws of Conservation</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/conservation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 25 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/conservation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We re-examine the conservation of energy and momentum we learned in middle school from a purely mathematical perspective, and then we derive the conservation of angular momentum from the same perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我们从纯数学的角度来重新审视中学学过的能量守恒和动量守恒,然后我们再通过同样的角度得出角动量守恒。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Centrol Force</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/centrolforce/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/centrolforce/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Introduction on Coordination System</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/coordinates/</link><pubDate>Tue, 19 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/coordinates/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Hamillton's Principle</title><link>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/physics/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://visysl.com/zh/post/principia/physics/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;最近学习分析力学，朗道那本《力学》开篇就是最小作用量原理，把人搞得非常晕。只看那本书是不行的，完全是毫无感情的客观描述，
对于理解这种抽象的定律毫无帮助。去年年初就打算学习理论力学，当时找了哈工大任延宇老师的理论力学公开课看，当时感觉讲得非常好，&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>